{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "先排序为 [-4,-1,-1,0,1,2]，依次固定一个数，再用左右指针寻找另外两个数。三数之和偏小时右移左指针，偏大时左移右指针，等于 0 时记录答案并跳过重复值。示例最终得到两个不重复三元组 [-1,-1,2] 和 [-1,0,1]。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>三数之和可视化</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.title{font-size:14px;font-weight:650;margin:0}.step{color:#3794ff;font-size:10px}.source{margin-top:6px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}.mono,.cell,.sum,.answer{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.track{height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px;margin:8px 0;overflow:hidden}.bar{height:100%;background:#3794ff;width:0;transition:width .45s ease}.array{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,38px);gap:6px;margin-top:8px}.slot{text-align:center}.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#252526;font-size:14px;transition:.35s}.idx{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:4px}.tag{height:14px;margin-bottom:2px;font-size:10px;color:transparent;transition:.35s}.slot.fixed .cell{border-color:#3794ff;background:#0e639c;color:#fff}.slot.left .cell{border-color:#4ec9b0;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #4ec9b0}.slot.right .cell{border-color:#ce9178;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #ce9178}.slot.fixed .tag{color:#75beff}.slot.left .tag{color:#4ec9b0}.slot.right .tag{color:#ce9178}.math{margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.sum{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center}.reason{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}.reason strong{color:#d4d4d4}.answers{margin-top:8px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid #3c3c3c;display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px}.answer{padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;background:#0e639c;color:#fff;font-size:13px;opacity:.25;transform:scale(.96);transition:.35s}.answer.on{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}.legend{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.dot{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:4px}.fixedDot{background:#3794ff}.leftDot{background:#4ec9b0}.rightDot{background:#ce9178}</style></head><body><main><div class=\"top\"><div class=\"title\">排序 + 固定一个数 + 双指针</div><div class=\"step\" id=\"step\"></div></div><div class=\"source\">示例：<span class=\"mono\">[-1,0,1,2,-1,-4]</span> → 排序后</div><div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" id=\"bar\"></div></div><div class=\"array\" id=\"array\"></div><div class=\"math\"><div class=\"sum\" id=\"sum\"></div><div class=\"reason\" id=\"reason\"></div></div><div class=\"answers\"><span>已收集：</span><span class=\"answer\" id=\"a1\">[-1,-1,2]</span><span class=\"answer\" id=\"a2\">[-1,0,1]</span></div><div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot fixedDot\"></i>固定值 i</span><span><i class=\"dot leftDot\"></i>左指针 L</span><span><i class=\"dot rightDot\"></i>右指针 R</span></div></main><script>const nums=[-1,0,1,2,-1,-4].sort((a,b)=>a-b),frames=[];let count=0;\nfor(let i=0;i<nums.length-2;i++){\n if(i>0&&nums[i]===nums[i-1]){frames.push({i,l:-1,r:-1,s:null,msg:'固定值 '+nums[i]+' 与上一轮重复, 跳过当前 i.',n:count});continue;}\n if(nums[i]>0){frames.push({i,l:-1,r:-1,s:null,msg:'固定值大于 0, 后面的数也为正, 结束搜索.',n:count});break;}\n let l=i+1,r=nums.length-1;\n while(l<r){const sum=nums[i]+nums[l]+nums[r];\n  if(sum===0){count++;frames.push({i,l,r,s:sum,msg:'记录 ['+[nums[i],nums[l],nums[r]].join(',')+'], 随后 L 右移、R 左移并跳过相同值.',n:count});l++;r--;while(l<r&&nums[l]===nums[l-1])l++;while(l<r&&nums[r]===nums[r+1])r--;}\n  else {frames.push({i,l,r,s:sum,msg:sum<0?'和小于 0, L 右移以增大三数之和.':'和大于 0, R 左移以减小三数之和.',n:count});if(sum<0)l++;else r--;}\n }\n frames.push({i,l:-1,r:-1,s:null,msg:'L 与 R 已相遇或交错, 当前固定点处理结束.',n:count});\n}\nframes.push({i:-1,l:-1,r:-1,s:null,msg:'搜索完成, 共找到 2 个不重复三元组. 时间 O(n²), 额外空间取决于排序实现, 不计答案.',n:count});\nconst array=document.getElementById('array');nums.forEach((v,k)=>{const e=document.createElement('div');e.className='slot';e.innerHTML='<div class=\"tag\"></div><div class=\"cell\">'+v+'</div><div class=\"idx\">索引 '+k+'</div>';array.appendChild(e)});let p=0;function show(){const f=frames[p];[...array.children].forEach((e,k)=>{e.className='slot';e.querySelector('.tag').textContent='';if(k===f.i){e.classList.add('fixed');e.querySelector('.tag').textContent='i'}if(k===f.l){e.classList.add('left');e.querySelector('.tag').textContent='L'}if(k===f.r){e.classList.add('right');e.querySelector('.tag').textContent='R'}});document.getElementById('step').textContent='步骤 '+(p+1)+' / '+frames.length;document.getElementById('bar').style.width=((p+1)/frames.length*100)+'%';document.getElementById('sum').textContent=f.s===null?'本帧不计算三数之和':nums[f.i]+' + '+nums[f.l]+' + '+nums[f.r]+' = '+f.s;document.getElementById('reason').innerHTML=f.msg;document.getElementById('a1').classList.toggle('on',f.n>=1);document.getElementById('a2').classList.toggle('on',f.n>=2);p=(p+1)%frames.length}show();setInterval(show,1800);</script></body></html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(n²)",
  "space_complexity": "O(n)",
  "complexity_note": "n 为数组长度. 排序后固定一个数并用双指针扫描; 双指针本身额外 O(1). 空间按常见排序实现的 O(n) 辅助空间上界计, 使用 O(log n) 栈的原地排序可降低该开销. 不含结果; r 个三元组另占 O(r)."
}
